    "detailed_description": "Paws for Adventure is a retro styled adventure game inspired by old school Zelda games but with cats.<br>Play the part of Cocoa a black cat who gets separated from his owners and ends up living with wild cats in the forest. Legend, action and adventures await as Cocoa fights, sings and hunts his way through the land.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996360/extras/5fc6e1d3e465671675ce8eac86a09057.poster.avif?t=1726251351\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996360/extras/5fc6e1d3e465671675ce8eac86a09057.webm?t=1726251351\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Hunt prey for food. Each animal gives different boosts to stats so keep an eye out for the more elusive prey. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996360/extras/39ac9d019e109bce08c53699bad8cf16.poster.avif?t=1726251351\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996360/extras/39ac9d019e109bce08c53699bad8cf16.apng?t=1726251351\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Sleep at the graves of past cats. Cats who have passed on may have important skills to teach you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996360/extras/d0be441435c5d2045c7e0048c5590c7d.poster.avif?t=1726251351\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996360/extras/d0be441435c5d2045c7e0048c5590c7d.webp?t=1726251351\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>Meow magical melodies. Different songs will have different effects on yourself or the world around you.<br><br><div cla